# ===========================================================================
# SIM 5 -- Carbonate check, unchanged from test_B2 (already answered cleanly:
#   with Hdg in play, carbon still participates in calcite saturation).
# ===========================================================================
SOLUTION 5 decoupled-Hdg with Ca
    temp      1.45
    pH        11.5
    units     mol/kgw
    Na        0.1
    Cl        0.1 charge
    Ca        1e-3
    C         1e-3
    Hdg       1e-3
    water     1
    pressure  66.7
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 5
    Calcite     0 0
END
